    "No direct experimental measurement exists for the query molecule itself; the prediction relies on high-transfer analogues.",
    "The query contains a sulfone-hydrazide and nitrile-alkyne motif not exactly represented in the tested analogues, so transporter-mediated efflux or metabolic instability cannot be fully excluded."
  ],
